  "id": "blueberry-buckle",
  "name": "Blueberry Buckle",
  "subtitle": "A tender blueberry cake with a cinnamon crumb topping",
  "description": "Fresh blueberries bake into a soft, lightly spiced cake finished with a buttery crumb layer.",
